From d283e43c677e50e4e2aa572c1a8b1b7f760f0c4d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 05:57:57 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] sched: port BORE 7.0.0 onto EEVDF (6.1 / KMI-neutral)

bore_ctx lives in task_struct ANDROID_KABI slots 4-8 (sizeof unchanged).
Keeps SAGA's sched_bore_topapp_discount / _smooth_boost. DELAY_ZERO and
delayed-dequeue paths of upstream are not part of this port.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DREwy12p2CD14uT4q9ENmB
